<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN V TASMANIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN V TASMANIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART, Australia 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
