<p>third day of a four-day match between Pakistan and Tasmania at</p>
<p>Bellerive Oval on Saturday:</p>
<p>Pakistan first innings 299</p>
<p>Tasmania first innings (overnight 392 for six)</p>
<p> D.Hills c Mohammad Zahid b Mushtaq Ahmed	29</p>
<p> J.Cox c Moin Khan b Wasim Akram		  200</p>
<p> D.Marsh st Moin Khan b Mushtaq Ahmed	    28</p>
<p> R.Ponting c and b Mohammad Zahid		  35</p>
